CORE
F12Old
--function F12Old.caller --modular -cp target/classes
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR
^.*FAILURE$
--
Regression for JVerify.old() lowering and modular verification.
Pre-fix: JVerify.old(counter) was a stub call that threw
ContractException; the captured c_ensures referenced an
unconstrained value and the wrapper couldn't bind it.

Post-fix: the pre-pass rewrites JVerify.old() calls to
history_exprt(arg, ID_old), resolve_stack_temps fully resolves
the diamond-temp + return_tmp chain, and DFCC's
replace_history_old binds the history to the pre-state value.
The caller chains two bump() calls and verifies
counter == initial + 2 under modular substitution.
